    "rules": [
      "All tasters score the SAME brew from the same batch, poured into identical cups.",
      "No discussion, no visible logging, until every record is submitted.",
      "Score all six axes 0-1 even if unsure — blanks bias the agreement rate.",
      "Free descriptors are verbatim: write 'chamomile' if that is what you taste, do not translate yourself.",
      "Vary the coffee across sessions (washed / natural / anaerobic, light and medium) — calibrating on one style only teaches one style.",
      "With 3 calibrators, a session is admissible with any 2 present — panel spread is still measurable. A single calibrator gives translation data but no spread, so that session's reliability contribution is dropped."
